mixin location(props = {})
	-
		props = {
			dropdown: props.dropdown || false
		}

	.location.js-location&attributes(attributes)
		button.location__button.js-modal-open(type='button', data-modal='#modal-location')
			span.location__label Ваш город
			+icon('location')
			span.location__value.js-location-value Москва

		if props.dropdown
			.location__dropdown.js-location-dropdown(aria-label='Подтверждение города')
				.location__title Ваш город <span class='js-location-define'></span>?
				.location__action
					button.button.button--outline.js-location-modal(type='button') Выбрать другой
					button.button.button--primary.js-location-approve(type='button') Да, всё верно
